{"version":1,"content":"<p>識食當然要不時不食，入冬後自然要食當造時令美食，有大廚就選用季節食材，配以精湛手藝，炮製出合時美饌，讓舌尖感受冬日「味」力。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;當造食材入饌&lt;br/&gt;尖沙咀酒店高級中餐廳主廚林熙偉師傅趁住冬季，於即日至2027</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:24:22.877067+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:15.312737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:15.312737+00:00","content_hash":"5ad24d52fd7b2ce69ee82a5925f34071391cf019f9cabe81d563e8200948ed32","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}